  "description": "GeoPandas.Net — next-generation geospatial analytics for .NET 10. Meta-package bundling Core (GeoDataFrame), Geometry (CRS, spatial index), Data (GeoJSON, Shapefile, GeoPackage, CSV, FlatGeobuf, dataset versioning), Arrow (GeoParquet, Arrow IPC), PointCloud (LAS/LAZ), Sql (PostGIS, SQL Server, DuckDB, Oracle), Survey (traverse, least-squares adjustment, RINEX/GNSS), RemoteSensing (Landsat, Sentinel-2, STAC, MODIS/VIIRS), Civil (alignments, corridors, earthwork), BIM (IFC ⇄ GIS), Scene (glTF, 3D Tiles), Twin (live IoT layers), Cloud (Azure Maps, AWS Location, Azure Digital Twins), Analytics, Network, Raster, CAD, AI and Datasets, plus the `Gpd` facade. Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil.",
